{
  "$comment": "Oiê's own tokens (design/product/oie/README.md): the core tokens it pulls with \"@\", what only Oiê has, and the contrast pairs it must pass in light and dark.",
  "layer": {
    "$comment": "Oiê (gabrielbr/familyzap), Android, Jetpack Compose (app.oie.ui.theme). Light and dark. Dressed in the Oiê brand (brands.oie). Fairy mode is not carried: the owner's decision, 2026-11-18 (it would bring pink back, which the brand bans, see 01 Brand/imagery-and-icons.md).",
    "consumers": [
      "Oiê (familyzap/app, not started)"
    ],
    "themes": [
      "light",
      "dark"
    ],
    "brand": "oie",
    "color": [
      "@page",
      "@surface",
      "@ink",
      "@muted",
      "@line",
      "@mint",
      "@on-mint",
      "@coral",
      "@coral-text",
      "@coral-soft",
      {
        "name": "on-coral",
        "pair": true,
        "value": {
          "light": "#FFFFFF",
          "dark": "#1F1210"
        },
        "usage": "Text and icons on a stop fill: 5.9:1 (light), 8.1:1 (dark)."
      },
      {
        "name": "selected",
        "value": {
          "light": "#FCE1D6",
          "dark": "#4A2620"
        },
        "usage": "What is picked in a set that isn't an action: the active tab, a picked chip, a chosen contact. A soft coral blush, so the filled coral stays the one action."
      },
      {
        "name": "on-selected",
        "value": {
          "light": "#2A1714",
          "dark": "#FBEFE6"
        },
        "usage": "Ink on selected: 13.7:1 (light), 11.7:1 (dark)."
      },
      {
        "name": "frame-line",
        "value": {
          "light": "#E8573C",
          "dark": "#E8573C"
        },
        "usage": "The frame round every screen (the core rule), in the brand coral."
      },
      {
        "name": "snackbar",
        "value": {
          "light": "#2A1714",
          "dark": "#FBEFE6"
        },
        "usage": "Snackbar ground (ink); its text is page."
      },
      {
        "name": "qr-ground",
        "value": {
          "light": "#FFFFFF",
          "dark": "#FFFFFF"
        },
        "usage": "The QR code's ground: always white, in both themes, so the phone's camera reads it."
      },
      {
        "name": "qr-ink",
        "value": {
          "light": "#2A1714",
          "dark": "#2A1714"
        },
        "usage": "The QR code's modules: always dark on qr-ground. Also the caption on the QR card."
      },
      {
        "name": "draw-paper",
        "value": {
          "light": "#FFFFFF",
          "dark": "#FFFFFF"
        },
        "usage": "The drawing pad's paper (v0.33): always white, in both themes, so the picture the family gets looks the same."
      },
      {
        "name": "draw-ink",
        "value": {
          "light": "#2A1714",
          "dark": "#2A1714"
        },
        "usage": "Drawing colour: ink. The pad's colours are fixed in both themes because the drawing is sent as a picture."
      },
      {
        "name": "draw-coral",
        "value": {
          "light": "#E8573C",
          "dark": "#E8573C"
        },
        "usage": "Drawing colour: the brand coral."
      },
      {
        "name": "draw-sun",
        "value": {
          "light": "#E0A100",
          "dark": "#E0A100"
        },
        "usage": "Drawing colour: sun yellow. A swatch always has a hairline and a name, never colour alone."
      },
      {
        "name": "draw-leaf",
        "value": {
          "light": "#2E9E5B",
          "dark": "#2E9E5B"
        },
        "usage": "Drawing colour: leaf green."
      },
      {
        "name": "draw-sky",
        "value": {
          "light": "#2F7FD8",
          "dark": "#2F7FD8"
        },
        "usage": "Drawing colour: sky blue."
      },
      {
        "name": "scrim",
        "value": {
          "light": "#732A1714",
          "dark": "#B30E0807"
        },
        "usage": "Behind a sheet or dialog (v0.34): warm ink at 45% by day, near-black at 70% at night, so it always darkens."
      }
    ],
